  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening institutional capacity of the Ministry of Economics and Finance (MEF) to improve results oriented M&amp;E (BF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to strengthen DGCOOP&apos;s institutional  capacity to improve the results-based monitoring and evaluation  of externally financed projects and programs in Burkina Faso. The objective of the grant is to establish a clear M&amp;E framework in the Minister of Economy and Finance supported by operational guidelines, as well as a standardized system of regular and ongoing M&amp;E training.</narrative>
  </description>
